{"count":2,"next_page":null,"page":1,"page_count":1,"per_page":8,"previous_page":null,"results":[{"id":115000305388,"url":"https://clo3d.zendesk.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles/115000305388.json","html_url":"https://support.clo3d.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000305388-Select-Mesh-Apply-to-Selected-Meshes","author_id":16675986987,"comments_disabled":true,"draft":false,"promoted":false,"position":0,"vote_sum":9,"vote_count":25,"upvote_count":17,"downvote_count":8,"section_id":115000885367,"created_at":"2016-12-19T05:24:20Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T16:26:35Z","name":"Select Mesh \u0026 Apply to Selected Meshes","title":"Select Mesh \u0026 Apply to Selected Meshes","source_locale":"en-us","locale":"en-us","outdated":false,"outdated_locales":[],"edited_at":"2022-12-13T02:05:50Z","user_segment_id":null,"permission_group_id":171828,"content_tag_ids":[],"label_names":[],"body":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-x-large\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eList of Contents\u003c/strong\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"#Click1\"\u003eSelect Mesh (Brush) / (Lasso) / (Box)\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"#Click2\"\u003eApply to Selected Meshes\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-large wysiwyg-color-black\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eObjective \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSelect some meshes of 3D garment or apply Subdivided, Freeze, Solidify, Solidify to selected meshes. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://youtu.be/CW6ux_ABzRw\" target=\"_self\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eWatch tutorial video here. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium wysiwyg-color-black\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-large\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLocation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eMain Menu ▶ 3D Garment ▶ ▶ \u003cstrong\u003eSelect Mesh (Brush) / (Box)\u003c/strong\u003e /\u003cstrong\u003e (Lasso)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e3D Toolbar ▶ \u003cimg src=\"https://support.clo3d.com/hc/article_attachments/900008246903/mceclip0.png\" alt=\"mceclip0.png\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e(Click for more than 2 seconds) ▶ \u003cstrong\u003eSelect Mesh (Brush) / (Box)\u003c/strong\u003e /\u003cstrong\u003e (Lasso)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-large\"\u003eOperation\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-large\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-color-blue\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-color-black wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003ca name=\"Click1\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-color-blue\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-color-black\"\u003eSelect Mesh (Brush) / (Box) / (Lasso)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eSelect the tool/ menu indicated.\u003cbr\u003e   \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cfont\u003e \u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eClick and drag the desired area on a garment. \u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e→ The area is selected.\u003c/span\u003e \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium wysiwyg-color-red80\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e※Note: \u003c/strong\u003e \u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e \u003cfont\u003e \u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e \u003c/font\u003e \u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eSelect Mesh (Brush) - Set Strength, Size, and Focal in the Brush window at the top-right corner.\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e \u003cfont\u003e \u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e \u003c/font\u003e \u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-small\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eSelect Mesh (Lasso) / (Box) - To select meshes additionally, press Shift+Ctrl on the keyboard then click and drag on the garment. To deselect the selected area, press Ctrl and click and drag on the garment.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eSelect Mesh (Lasso) / (Box) - Double click a Pattern outline/ internal line in either the 3D/ 2D window to select Mesh along the segment. When selecting Mesh on the Pattern, adjacent segment vertices are also selected.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e     \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-color-black wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca name=\"Click2\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSubdivide / Freeze / Solidify (ver 6.1) / \u003cspan\u003eStrengthen \u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e(ver 7.1)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eSelect the tool/ menu indicated.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e \u003cfont\u003e \u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eRight-click on the selected meshes and select the menu \u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-color-black wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSubdivide / Freeze / Solidify (ver 6.1) / \u003cspan\u003eStrengthen (ver 7.1).\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e→ Each menu is applied to the meshes and displayed in different colors. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e \u003c/font\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e \u003cfont\u003e \u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eSet the properties of the applied options \u003cspan\u003ein the property editor.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e \u003c/font\u003e \u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 768px; height: 52px;\" border=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 22px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\" style=\"width: 145.188px; height: 42px;\" rowspan=\"3\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSubdivide(Mesh)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\" style=\"width: 78.9375px; height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eName\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\" style=\"width: 509.875px; height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e Name the subdivided mesh area.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 22px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\" style=\"width: 78.9375px; height: 10px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eLevel\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\" style=\"width: 509.875px; height: 10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e Set the subdivision level of mesh. The higher the value is, the smaller the mesh is. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 22px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\" style=\"width: 78.9375px; height: 10px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eSmooth\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\" style=\"width: 509.875px; height: 10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e Subdivide the area between the subdivided area and the normal area progressively.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 22px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\" style=\"width: 145.188px; height: 10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e \u003cfont size=\"2\"\u003eSolidify/Strengthen\u003c/font\u003e \u003c/strong\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 78.9375px; height: 10px;\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStrength\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 509.875px; height: 10px;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e Set the intensity of Solidify and Strengthen.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e  \u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eTo apply the desired option, right click the mesh area that each option is applied to.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium wysiwyg-color-red80\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e※Note: \u003c/strong\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eRight-click an empty area in the 3D window and click the Show/ Hide Color menu to hide each color of the mesh areas.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"article-body\"\u003e\n\u003carticle\u003e\n\u003carticle\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"main-content\" class=\"wiki-content\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/article\u003e\n\u003c/article\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"article-voting\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"article-vote\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e","user_segment_ids":[],"snippet":" Name the subdivided mesh area. Level Set the \u003cem\u003esubdivision\u003c/em\u003e level of mesh. The higher the value is, the smaller the","result_type":"article"},{"id":44177925839897,"url":"https://clo3d.zendesk.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles/44177925839897.json","html_url":"https://support.clo3d.com/hc/en-us/articles/44177925839897-Rendering-Thickness","author_id":29011015255193,"comments_disabled":false,"draft":false,"promoted":false,"position":0,"vote_sum":2,"vote_count":2,"upvote_count":2,"downvote_count":0,"section_id":115000628707,"created_at":"2025-03-06T02:26:22Z","updated_at":"2025-08-29T02:50:56Z","name":"Rendering Thickness","title":"Rendering Thickness","source_locale":"en-us","locale":"en-us","outdated":false,"outdated_locales":[],"edited_at":"2025-08-29T02:50:55Z","user_segment_id":null,"permission_group_id":171828,"content_tag_ids":[],"label_names":[],"body":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"height: auto;\" src=\"https://support.clo3d.com/hc/article_attachments/45512112952729\" alt=\"_Divider.png\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\"\u003eSet the rendering thickness for the patterns.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp id=\"h_01JRAQ7M51ETSBFEJXSWDP31DC\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\" style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\"\u003eRendering thickness value is only visible and does not Simulate as the thickness value space out between Fabrics. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"height: auto;\" src=\"https://support.clo3d.com/hc/article_attachments/45512112952729\" alt=\"_Divider.png\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eSelect the pattern to set the rendering thickness.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cem\u003e* To see the rendering thickness, \u003ca href=\"https://support.clo3d.com/hc/en-us/articles/115001025968-3D-Window-Display-Icons#Click3\"\u003e3D Garment Rendering\u003c/a\u003e Style must be set to one of the thick-surface styles.\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eSet the thickness options in Property Editor.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; height: 338px; width: 730px;\" border=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 22px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\" style=\"width: 140.188px; height: 22px;\" bgcolor=\"f0f0f3\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOption\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\" style=\"width: 566.812px; height: 22px;\" colspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"f0f0f3\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"50\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDescription\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 22px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\" style=\"width: 140.188px; height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdd'l Thickness - Rendering\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"height: 22px; width: 566.812px;\" colspan=\"2\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"50\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eEnter desired rendering thickness value.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"205\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eThis value is for rendering purposes only and does not affect collisions. However, when exporting, enabling the Thick option will export both the Side and Back Mesh and UVs\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e✨Tip:\u003c/strong\u003eCollision thickness can be adjusted at [Simation Properties ▶ Add'l Thickness - Collision]. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 22px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\" style=\"width: 140.188px; height: 174px;\" rowspan=\"8\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtrusion Direction\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 566.812px; height: 22px;\" colspan=\"2\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eSpecify the direction in which thickness is applied based on the Pattern Plane.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 44px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\" style=\"width: 82.125px; height: 44px;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBoth\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 473.688px; height: 44px;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eApply thickness evenly to both the front and back based on the Pattern.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 22px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\" style=\"width: 82.125px; height: 22px;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eForward\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 473.688px; height: 22px;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003eApply thickness forward.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 22px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\" style=\"width: 82.125px; height: 22px;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBackward\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n